


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_c3e4e010:


    "周六午后。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_2d435f2c:


    "起居室里只有阳菜和伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_12da09b7:


    "文刚回了老家，而圣夜子也不见人影。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_a93cb877:


    "也就是两人独处。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_badb9246:


    "文出门之后，阳菜一直坐立不安。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_48e071cd:


    "她的鼻子呼呼地喘着粗气，明显是饥渴难耐。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_80498972:


    "从前一阵子的“沉重”事件起，阳菜便尝试自制。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_ff396b3e:


    "回房时必有的虎扑熊抱也（好像）减轻了力度。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_879bb560:


    "然而，副作用肯定是有的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_a4cfd9b6:


    "被压抑的心情越强，累积的忍耐就越多。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_b02f2ccd:


    "然后终于到了两人独处的时间。这一切即刻就要爆发——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_98f847ba:



    voice "2HI_0979"
    hina "「伦——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_939ced40:



    voice "2RI_0942"
    rin "「啊，抱歉。我今天不行」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_88f00c90:



    voice "2HI_0980"
    hina "「诶……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_4d75db4e:


    "阳菜发出了奇怪的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_c241990e:



    voice "2HI_0981"
    hina "「啊，是、是这样啊……那、那就、没办法了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_55b01f6e:


    "阳菜摇摇晃晃地往后退去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_fdbe5715:



    voice "2RI_0943"
    rin "「想做？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_f24d9072:



    voice "2HI_0982"
    hina "「没、没有啊～只是觉得伦要是想做我就答应一下呗……碰巧我牙也刷了，澡也洗了，内衣也换好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_0df39da7:



    voice "2RI_0944"
    rin "「……你真的很想做啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_68ccbdec:



    voice "2HI_0983"
    hina "「才、才没有呀」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_17fdcdd5:


    "阳菜扭过脸去。大概双耳通红。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_116c75bf:



    voice "2HI_0984"
    hina "「……啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_67be91e0:


    "伦轻轻抱住了她的头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_d6979bb3:



    voice "2RI_0945"
    rin "「那，做吗？我还是可以攻的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_43578696:



    voice "2HI_0985"
    hina "「……不了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_2c9a72e1:


    "阳菜思考片刻，摇摇脑袋。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_d60573d0:



    voice "2RI_0946"
    rin "「真的？你不是超想做嘛？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_e64b6a5a:



    voice "2HI_0986"
    hina "「确实……很想。但今天还是算了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_af11297d:



    voice "2RI_0947"
    rin "「这样啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_5ebf5064:


    "话是这么说，但阳菜的表情明显很沮丧。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_6399da15:



    voice "2RI_0948"
    rin "「呐，阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_75cf6043:



    voice "2HI_0987"
    hina "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_e805c4fb:



    voice "2RI_0949"
    rin "「明天去约会吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_27284b7a:



    voice "2HI_0988"
    hina "「真的！？去哪？去哪约会！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_a86e6da4:


    "仅此一语，就让阳菜的表情瞬间重焕光彩。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_cd41124c:



    voice "2RI_0950"
    rin "「呃，我也是刚想到的，还没具体考虑过。你有想去的地方吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_ed749d0b:



    voice "2HI_0989"
    hina "「伦带我去哪都可以！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_4381aa3d:


    "仿佛能看见左右摆动的尾巴。就像开心等着散步的小狗。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_9d12779d:



    voice "2RI_0951"
    rin "「虽然是我提出来的这么问有些奇怪，但至于这么高兴嘛？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_e068ca5e:



    voice "2HI_0990"
    hina "「因为这是第一次正式约会啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_825f6afa:



    voice "2RI_0952"
    rin "「是、是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_b37e6044:



    voice "2HI_0991"
    hina "「每次一到两个人独处，伦就立马开始H。嘛，今天只是碰巧反过来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_94a70bce:



    voice "2RI_0953"
    rin "「哦、噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_02_aee906d3:


    "好的，自掘坟墓。"
